OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club backs men's mental
OL,4,Ahealth initiative
OL,5,
OL,6,FMental health support is reaching
OL,7,Ffootball fans where they gather most.
OL,9,FAn initiative has been launched in the
OL,10,Fsafe standing section of the lower John
OL,11,FRobertson Stand at Nottingham Forest's
OL,12,FCity Ground to encourage supporters to
OL,13,Fopen up about their mental health.
OL,15,FA QR code in the stand provides access
OL,16,Fto mental health charity Say It Lad's
OL,17,Fwebsite, where visitors can listen to
OL,18,Fanonymous voice notes shared by men
OL,19,Ftalking openly about their own
OL,20,Fexperiences and can also record their
OL,21,Fown.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
