OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club backs men's mental
OL,4,Ahealth initiative
OL,5,
OL,6,FColin Eley, health and wellbeing
OL,7,Fmanager at Nottingham Forest
OL,8,FFoundation, said the main goal was to
OL,9,Fmake sure people "don't feel alone in
OL,10,Fgoing through any kind of mental health
OL,11,Fchallenges".
